        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-05-17/pdf/96-12720.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (‘‘Board’’) . There is established\neffective May 15, 1996, a Board of three members to be appointed by\nthe President to investigate any and all of the disputes raised in mediation.\nNo member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any organization\nof railroad employees or any railroad carrier. The Board shall perform its\nfunctions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2645,
      "char_start": 2530,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13003#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13003#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "61 FR 25131, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "201557d918619a0550c55213dd108bf7f2678f6ce9135f3ba7d1e66db1035444",
        "signing_date": "1996-05-15",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13003.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7f946af1acd8f33faa0156acd09a6b87df8fe9f5a476b1a4bea8615a46250cc1",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-05-17/pdf/96-12720.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to\nthe dispute within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2973,
      "char_start": 2646,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13003#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13003#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "61 FR 25131, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "201557d918619a0550c55213dd108bf7f2678f6ce9135f3ba7d1e66db1035444",
        "signing_date": "1996-05-15",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13003.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7f946af1acd8f33faa0156acd09a6b87df8fe9f5a476b1a4bea8615a46250cc1",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-05-17/pdf/96-12720.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by section 10 of the Act, from\nthe date of the creation of the Board and for 30 days after the Board\nhas made its report to the President, no change, except by agreement of\nthe parties shall be made by the railroads or the employees in the conditions\nout of which the disputes arose."
    },
